<title>USA: Globe Q2 shr falls, after yr-ago gain.</title>
<headline>Globe Q2 shr falls, after yr-ago gain.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI, Ohio 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.26		    $0.38</p>
<p> Net			  1,123		    1,107</p>
<p> Revs			17,710		   12,960</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,309		    2,546</p>
<p>	  Six months ended Aug 31</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.45		    $0.61</p>
<p> Net			  1,947		    1,829</p>
<p> Revs			30,823		   25,222</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,282		    2,552</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Reported results include favorable impact on gross profit from 1993 GranTree acquisition, which added $0.13 per share to net income in the second quarter of fiscal 1996 and $0.25 per share to net income in the first six months of fiscal 1996.</p>
<p>The gross profit impact from the acquisition expired in the third quarter of fiscal 1996.</p>
<p>Full company name is Globe Business Resources Inc.</p>
